#: config.cpp:40
msgid "Draw window frames using &titlebar colors"
msgstr "Woknowy ramik w barbach &titla rysować"

#: config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, the window decoration borders are drawn using the titlebar "
"colors. Otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors instead."
msgstr ""
"Hdyž je to wubrane, so ramik woknow w barbach titloweho paska rysuja. Hewak "
"so normalne ramikowe barby wužiwaja."

#~ msgid "Decoration Settings"
#~ msgstr "Nastajenja za dekoraciju woknow"
